<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/13th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Franco-Flemish War (1297–1305)</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1297–1305</span> · <a href="/centuries/13th-century">13th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Franco-Flemish War was fought from 1297 to 1305 between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/philip-iv-of-france">Philip IV of France</a> and Guy of Dampierre, Count of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/flanders">Flanders</a>. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> occupied Flanders, but the Flemish towns revolted and defeated the French knights at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-golden-spurs">Battle of the Golden Spurs</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kortrijk">Courtrai</a> in 1302; after the French victory at Mons-en-Pévèle (1304), the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-athis-sur-orge">Treaty of Athis-sur-Orge</a> (1305) imposed heavy terms on Flanders while leaving it autonomous.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/franco-flemish-war-1297-1305.jpg" alt="Franco-Flemish War (1297–1305)" width="320" height="110" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown sculptor, Chest of Courtrai · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Goedendag_on_chest_of_Kortrijk.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section><h2 class="enc-section-title">Battles and settlements</h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-mons-en-pevele"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-mons-en-pevele.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Battle of Mons-en-Pévèle</span><span class="tp">Battle · 18 August 1304</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/matins-of-bruges"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/matins-of-bruges.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Matins of Bruges</span><span class="tp">Revolt · 18 May 1302</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-golden-spurs"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-golden-spurs.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Battle of the Golden Spurs</span><span class="tp">Battle · 1302</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-athis-sur-orge"><span class="ph ph-conflict" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Treaty of Athis-sur-Orge</span><span class="tp">Treaty · Peace · 1305</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
